        {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "data": {
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<h2>Delivery</h2><p>Ships in 24 hours; delivered in 2–4 working days.</p><ul><li>Delivery is free on orders above ₹1,999; otherwise a flat ₹99 applies.</li><li>Cash on delivery is available for a ₹49 handling fee.</li><li>You will receive tracking details by email and SMS once your order ships.</li></ul><h2>Returns</h2><p>Free size exchange within 15 days; returns on unused items.</p><p>To start a return, email team@stridesports.example with your order number. Refunds are made to the original payment method within 5–7 working days of receiving the item.</p>",
